{"version":1,"content":"<p>德國卡爾斯魯厄理工學院（KIT）研究團隊近日發佈最新研究成果指出，鐵粉有望成為未來清潔能源體系中的重要組成部分。這種可循環利用的燃料不僅能夠幫助儲存和運輸可再生能源，還可能讓逐步退出歷史舞台的燃煤電廠獲得新的用途，在實現氣候中和目標的同時提升電力系統穩定性。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1585700.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.155101+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T05:44:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"71388092ea2d2e1353077058cc07d5107c4215fbec0e88df365f062d06dd62de","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}